{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-roleplay-about-cafe-pastries-and-light-food-and-how-to-order-them-then-three-roleplay-s/audio/main-dfad32435808.mp3","durationSec":110.496,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3,"text":"Many cafes keep a glass case of pastries near the counter."},{"start":3.92,"end":6.24,"text":"A butter croissant is flaky and light."},{"start":7.06,"end":9.26,"text":"A blueberry muffin is soft and sweet."},{"start":10.2,"end":13.22,"text":"Some places also sell a cheese danish or a cinnamon roll."},{"start":14.08,"end":17.38,"text":"These cafe pastries are popular in the morning with tea or coffee."},{"start":18.18,"end":21.44,"text":"Light food is good when you want more than a snack but not a big meal."},{"start":22.38,"end":24.86,"text":"A chicken sandwich is easy to eat with your hands."},{"start":25.66,"end":28.8,"text":"A cheese toastie is a hot sandwich with melted cheese."},{"start":29.54,"end":31.78,"text":"A garden salad is cooler and lighter."},{"start":32.84,"end":37.24,"text":"At places like Pret A Manger, people often grab a sandwich or a salad to eat for lunch."},{"start":38.02,"end":41.76,"text":"You can ask what is fresh today, or point to the item you want in the case."},{"start":42.9,"end":45.42,"text":"Ordering food at a cafe follows a simple pattern."},{"start":46.08,"end":47.04,"text":"The barista greets you."},{"start":47.6,"end":49.02,"text":"You say the food item clearly."},{"start":49.8,"end":54.4,"text":"Then the barista may ask if you want it heated, or ask for here or to go."},{"start":55.28,"end":56.42,"text":"Keep the order short."},{"start":56.42,"end":61.38,"text":"Say the full dish name as one unit, such as butter croissant or garden salad."},{"start":62.22,"end":67.28,"text":"If you want a change, add it after the item: no butter, extra cheese, or no onion."},{"start":68.3,"end":70.06,"text":"After that, the barista tells you the price."},{"start":70.82,"end":73.72,"text":"You pay, then wait for your name or for the food at the counter."},{"start":74.64,"end":77.46,"text":"You can order food alone, or add a simple drink if you want."},{"start":77.46,"end":80.96,"text":"Practise the food words clearly before you add extras."},{"start":82.1,"end":84.9,"text":"After you name the food, you can ask for a small change."},{"start":85.54,"end":88.42,"text":"Say no onion, extra cheese, or no butter."},{"start":89.22,"end":91.86,"text":"If the food is cold, you can ask the barista to heat it up."},{"start":92.72,"end":94.48,"text":"These short lines keep the order clear."},{"start":95.38,"end":98.64,"text":"When the food is ready, the barista may call your name or bring it to the counter."},{"start":99.34,"end":101.26,"text":"You can pay by card or with cash."},{"start":102.18,"end":105.54,"text":"If you also want a drink, say the food first, then the drink."},{"start":106.58,"end":110.12,"text":"Keep each part short so the barista can repeat the order back to you."}],"words":[{"text":"Many","start":0,"end":0.28},{"text":"cafes","start":0.28,"end":0.66},{"text":"keep","start":0.66,"end":1},{"text":"a","start":1,"end":1.14},{"text":"glass","start":1.14,"end":1.42},{"text":"case","start":1.42,"end":1.64},{"text":"of","start":1.64,"end":1.88},{"text":"pastries","start":1.88,"end":2.36},{"text":"near","start":2.36,"end":2.56},{"text":"the","start":2.56,"end":2.72},{"text":"counter","start":2.72,"end":3},{"text":"A","start":3.92,"end":3.94},{"text":"butter","start":3.94,"end":4.2},{"text":"croissant","start":4.2,"end":4.76},{"text":"is","start":4.76,"end":5.12},{"text":"flaky","start":5.12,"end":5.56},{"text":"and","start":5.56,"end":5.96},{"text":"light","start":5.96,"end":6.24},{"text":"A","start":7.06,"end":7.18},{"text":"blueberry","start":7.18,"end":7.62},{"text":"muffin","start":7.62,"end":8.04},{"text":"is","start":8.04,"end":8.26},{"text":"soft","start":8.26,"end":8.68},{"text":"and","start":8.68,"end":8.94},{"text":"sweet","start":8.94,"end":9.2